{"server":"tw","storyId":"act4d0_level_act4d0_st06","groupId":"act4d0","stageId":null,"title":"北極星","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st06.txt","sourceHash":"338bcfa064f1f523295a3bfb8e904fc4862798598c72e936c89ddb3e9e4ebc05","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"北地的觀測站出現設備異常，為了今後可能會來的探險家，麥哲倫堅持冒險外出維修。\n然而來接她的幹員寒檀，卻在此時攔住了她。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"08:30 A.M 天氣/暴雪\n北地，因非冰原，萊茵生命420號臨時科考觀測站"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"系統已解鎖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"確定年份：未知"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間設置出現問題，現在轉到手工控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要進行下一步操作，請進行身份認證。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我想想......嗯，萊茵生命科學考察員，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"認證中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"認證完畢，聲音樣本已確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗶嗶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"指紋已確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（活潑的女聲）嗨，你好呀麥麥，歡迎回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好怪哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，早知道就不答應梅爾姐測試這個簽到系統了，好奇怪的功能啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，總而言之，開始幹活吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"今年最後一個勘察點，確認沒有新的發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"至此，本年度預定的勘查目標已經完成，確認其他各項任務完成後，將踏上返程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"寫報告可真是我最不擅長的東西了，還是來聽聽錄音吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（活潑的女聲）你好，麥麥。今天，是你本次外出勘察的第1，8，7天了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這一次也已經出來這麼久啦，我都沒有感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"裝置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（活潑的女聲）你已經出去很久了，也該回來了吧？大家都想你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！之前有這一段嗎......難道是梅爾姐偷偷錄的然後設置了觸發條件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，不管怎麼樣，居然還有這樣的小驚喜，好開心啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，說是說可以回去了，但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這場暴風雪，恐怕還要持續至少一周呢，唉，幸好物資儲備還算充裕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，還是來確認一遍任務表吧，我記得應該還有幾個沒有填的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看，嗯，周邊的樣本採集，完成。遺跡線索的尋找，沒有~也算完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"和去年比沒有什麼新發現呢，要是再來一個和大前年一樣的發現就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然說這才是常態啦，要是科長在肯定要批評我貪心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"應該沒有了吧......嗯？還有一項空著，新材料的低溫性質測試......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全忘記了這件事！！！不如說這個新材料被我放哪兒去了來著！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了糟了，這個要是丟了，我可要被殺掉了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，好險好險，居然被塞在外層口袋裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"外層口袋是零下43度，持續時間6小時，依然保持彈性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來測試一下硬度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也沒有問題。好，接下來放進實驗甕就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，幸虧還是有放在外套裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，反正現在是暴風雪，乾脆把它放到門外去擺一天看看低溫疲勞性好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"現在外面的氣溫應該很合適吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，麥哲倫，你要深呼吸，在打開門的瞬間，把東西丟出去，然後立刻關門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"要快，狠，準！不然暴風雪灌進來可就糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"1，2，3！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"請問......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫，你剛才好像看到了一個幽靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫，雖然她很漂亮，但一定是個幽靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這裡可是北地，怎麼可能會有別人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"難、難道說真的是雪中的幽靈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不行不行，要再開門看看，要用科學的眼光去看待！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有幽靈這種東西！我的體溫也沒有下降到出現幻覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一是新的族群，那就是大發現！加油啊，麥哲倫！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，我能進來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃......你......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不用害怕。我是活人，不信的話，摸摸我的臉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊，好暖和！怎麼會，這不是在北地嗎，怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......您是薩米人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道是哪裡讓你感到失望，不過我確實是薩米人。你好，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你好。雖然不知道你是怎麼到這裡來的，不過先進來吧，外面可不是普通人能活下來的溫度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是薩米人，對這樣的暴風雪也沒轍吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"給，熱茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐你叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"就叫我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜吧，西蒙娜。你的名字呢，小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"代號麥哲倫！萊茵生命科考專員，420號觀測站的負責人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"說是這麼說，其實現在只有我一個人在用啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜，你為什麼會來這裡？還被困在暴風雪裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"我是受人所托來找人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"找人？這裡可是北地哦，別說人了，我一個月連生物都見不到幾隻呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"委託我的人說，她應該就在這一帶活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"你找她要做什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這場暴風雪將會持續很久很久，她可能會耽擱一些時間。我是來這裡接她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，是這樣嗎？！你是來接我的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不太清楚呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這樣，不是接我的嗎，欸。可是，現在的天氣真的很惡劣，西蒙娜你不要緊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"薩米人......不，我瞭解雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"但天氣繼續惡劣下去的話，許多事情都會向沒法預測的方向變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，雖然我也看得出這場暴風雪可能要持續一段時間，但沒想到這麼嚴峻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"還想等風勢變弱一些再走呢......這樣的話，反而要加快行程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"按照日程表和觀測結果的話，明早可能是最佳時機了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，物資儲備也是足夠了，我做得不錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多物資，是給你一個人使用的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不是不是，這是為了讓生活在這個觀測站的人能堅持到明年科考季的時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"如果西蒙娜姐要在這裡住很久的話，也可以使用這些物資！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但是，實驗儀器，不可以亂碰哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，既然這麼決定了，那就開始整理行李吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜，不好意思，我要先準備一些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒關係，你去吧，不用管我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"行李箱，行李箱，行李箱去哪兒了來著？哦，想起來了，上個月被我拿來墊腳，放在廚房裡了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"測繪儀和無人機的狀況......嗯，沒有問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不過得充一下電才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有我可以幫上忙的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用，這些我一個人就能完成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來我都是一個人完成這些工作的，已經很熟練啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是在這裡工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯是的，我在這裡從事研究和考察工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"考察什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"整片北地冰原！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，只有你一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這就是我的工作啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不會很孤獨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"會！但是孤獨和快樂沒什麼矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我的同事們都在等我回去，也知道這片冰原還有無數秘密等著我去揭開，所以沒那麼可怕啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候我會很孤獨，不過很多時候，我也很快樂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人......這真的相當可怕。這樣的生活，我不知道該說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不是每個人都能像我一樣樂在其中啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"想要成為探險家，沒有點本事可不行呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，咳咳，是科考專員！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"你還......真是相當樂觀呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，借用一位前輩說的話，“探險家最好的朋友，就是孤獨”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不過科長說我好像養成了下意識自言自語的習慣。有嗎？應該沒有吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"挺好的呀，麥哲倫小姐。你是很好的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，嗯，哈哈，是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，觀測站的能源儲備應該也沒有問題，只要設定好時間進入休眠狀態就好，接下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，再說一下，除了科研設備，其它的西蒙娜都可以隨便用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊，謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"可我是感染者，這樣混用物資和設施，真的沒問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了不是嗎，麥哲倫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我看到了呀，西蒙娜你也沒刻意去掩蓋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"你不害怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"第一眼有些嚇人......是真的！畢竟這樣分佈的結晶真的很稀少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，姐姐實在是太漂亮了，那些結晶看起來都有些神秘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不用避諱我的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是眼睛......嗎？西蒙娜姐也要好好注意診療，那可是很危險的部分啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這並不是我想問的。我是想問，你不害怕感染嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這個不用擔心哦，萊茵生命的研究已經證明過很多次了，礦石病在人之間的傳染條件是有規律可循的，並沒有人們想的那麼可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很多人根本就不會去聽......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我有很多朋友和同事，都是感染者哦！沒問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，萊茵生命的醫學研究，雖然大家都很為我們的事業感到自豪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在感染者這個領域，是比不上一家叫做“羅德島”的醫藥公司的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然同事也很生氣，但不得不承認，他們在礦石病這個方面，確實很厲害呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"結果後來，萊茵生命乾脆就和羅德島進行了合作，就連我也要去羅德島了呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好期待啊，不知道會是怎麼樣的地方，我居然可以繼續參與科考工作！還以為就要一直住研究室了呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是很喜歡聊天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然了！其實能和別人說說話，非常開心！唔，要是我說的太多，西蒙娜可以隨時提醒，我會安靜下來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。我喜歡你講些我不知道的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，啊，有些不好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜你要是想的話，也可以去羅德島診治！對了，我帶你一起去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"你不怕我別有用心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"別有用心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那西蒙娜，你是不是壞人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，我是不是壞人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫，你有感覺到這裡的溫度降低了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"溫度？咦，這麼一說，確實比剛才要冷了一些......等等，難道說......"},{"type":"narration","text":"警報，檢測到溫控設施出現異常，即將切斷外層供暖功能。\n警報......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，西蒙娜，讓一下！我要看監控系統！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，材料老化導致外部供暖管道洩露了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我要出門一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來會發生什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"如果允許系統切斷外層供暖，觀測站會在科考季之前就停止運作。至少，沒辦法再提供生活功能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"還能支持幾天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個月左右吧......哪怕西蒙娜很熟悉雪，也沒辦法在這種地方生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的，我很快就會離開北地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還在收拾什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"準，準備出門呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才不是說能支撐到兩個月之後？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，那是絕對不行的！必須要支撐到下個科考季才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的風雪已經不是常人能承受的地步了。這樣艱難的環境，可能會危及你的生命，別出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，觀測站不僅僅是為了我運作的，它本來具備營地的作用，也應該一直維持下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這種天氣不會有別人來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜不就是在這種天氣裡走到這裡的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"我不一樣，我不是探險家，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿唷......加熱設備好重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那這座觀測站就更重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"對於探險家來說，觀測站這類營地就是他們生命的節點。一旦觀測站停運，那麼失去資源、走到了這裡的探險家，可能就會失去生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，從它建立開始直到今天，除了我，還有別的訪客嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，你的堅持真的有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼這麼肯定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"因為總有人會走過這裡，可能是明天，可能是下個科考季，也可能就是兩個月以後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是毫無根據的想法，麥哲倫，外面很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人會來這裡的，至少在旱季前，探險家們是不會來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐......你不是探險家，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，不同的探險家，有不同的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人會選擇在最平靜的時候走到這裡，為了能踏遍這個北地，現在還沒有人做到，但很多人一直在努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人會選擇在最危險的時候走到這裡，為的是能看到這片大地的所有變化，為的是能把這裡的種種記錄和景象，帶回文明世界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦爾的黑流樹海，卡西米爾的環山高地平原，伊比利亞的水下火山......這些地方，過去都沒有人去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在，已經有人去過了，在那裡，已經插上了探險家們的旗幟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上還有許多我們未曾踏足的地方，但那也只是說，我們還沒來得及踏足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，這片冰原已經有我踏足了，那麼，未來，總會有更多的人來到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也不會知道，他們是在什麼條件下走來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"如果終你一生，都沒有後來者呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你回去之後，這個科考站就會被廢棄呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不能為兩個月後的那一點點可能性，放棄哪怕是一位不存在的探險家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐......麥哲倫我，相信探險這種事業，相信探險家這種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天，我們的足跡會遍佈這一整片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......把希望寄託於可能不會發生的未來，真的不會失望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，對探險家來說，我們一生都在發現，我們也一生都在失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有探險家的發現是僅僅依靠自己完成的，每一個探險家都是站在前人的肩膀上，每一個重大的發現都連接著遙遠的過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像我會來到這片冰原，一開始，只是因為在小時候聽了一個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在我已經知道，無論我喜歡的那些存在不存在，我所做的，都有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是那個虛無縹緲的，會讓人失望的不存在的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"唉這個加熱器，功率會不會太大......上次把頭髮都烤焦了欸。不管，硬上啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！那我去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我替你去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐，你是來找人的吧？我們觀測站沒有雇傭其他雇員的需求哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經找到那個人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，就是麥哲倫我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"環境已經變得相當惡劣，預定要來的信使沒法通知你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"容我重新自我介紹一下。羅德島幹員，代號“寒檀”。我是來接你的。當然，你可以繼續叫我西蒙娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的工作讓我來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。外面的環境太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛這句話，是我說的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不行不行不行，我可是科考人員，這是我的責任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我修理的方法，幹員麥哲倫。外面的事情請交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那我知道了！這個，給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"按下這個按鈕，我就會立刻出來找你！還有這個裝備，這個裝備......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，謝謝你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的找對人了呢。不用了，麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以！我可不能讓西蒙娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"不。幹員麥哲倫......相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"這片土地也一樣信任著我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一生都在發現，也一生都在失望，嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢的薩米人，這種抵抗有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你確實很厲害，我們走不出這場暴風雪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那又怎麼樣？烏薩斯依然會碾壓你們，吞下你們的城市，吃掉你們的土地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女巫......我們不會殺掉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會死，我們卻要你活！你要活著，你要看整片大地都染血！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這東西送給你。我們這些死人的禮物，收下！用你的一隻眼睛，收下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"慘叫啊，哭啊，然後活著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們死得光榮，你活得卑微！而且......你要一直活著！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女巫！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的。我以前怎麼總是覺得這片大地會枯萎呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有這樣的孩子在，大地就會一直掙扎著繁茂下去才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，麥哲倫。有些事情對你來說還太難了，交給我們大人去做，我們也會很開心啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"“......聽啊♪......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"“......白色的生命肆意綻放，漆黑的種子深植土壤......♪”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"“歌唱吧，美麗的女孩。哭泣吧，美麗的女孩♪”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"“風雪會聽見你的歌，也會擁你入懷♪”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"——北地的風雪，聽見歌聲了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫......我啊，想看你堅持自己的夢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西蒙娜","speakerId":"char_341_amona","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，雪也該停了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","aliases":["麥哲倫"]},{"speakerId":"char_341_amona","aliases":["？？？","西蒙娜"]}]}
